    url: https://pxdata.stat.fi/PxWeb/api/v1/fi/StatFin/khi/11xt.px
    description: 'Kuluttajahintaindeksin kokonaisindeksit, annual. 2005 = 100: 2025
      146.5. 2015 = 100: 2016 100.4, 2022 113.4, 2025 122.7.; Format: PxWeb table;
